                <pb facs="0224" n="120" sameAs="frus:frus1932v05/pg120"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/2600: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Bolivia (Feely)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-12-07T14:00:00-05:00">December 7, 1932—2
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>55. Your 132, December 6, 11 p.m. Department hopes you will continue discreetly
                    to keep this matter before Bolivian authorities and endeavor to have them accept
                    proposal contained in Department’s No. 52 as modified by its No. 53. Please keep
                    Department informed by cable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
